            "headline": "Mox Bank offers QBE-backed home insurance through banking app",
            "name": "Mox Bank offers QBE-backed home insurance through banking app",
            "description": "Renters and landlords can access protection for household belongings and property structures.\nMox Bank Limited has launched Home Cushion Insurance, a fully digital home protection product accessible through the Mox mobile application.\nUnderwritten by QBE Hongkong \u0026 Shanghai Insurance Limited, the policy covers home contents, building structures, and third-party liability for renters, owner-occupiers, and landlords.\nThe policy provides third-party liability coverage of up to $1.27m (HK$10m).\nIt also includes relocation protection for up to 28 days for both current and new properties, transit coverage capped at 15% of the total sum insured, full replacement cost settlements for home contents without depreciation deductions, and temporary pet accommodation during major household displacements.\nCoverage is divided into three plans, offering up to $191,083 (HK$1.5m) for building structures and up to $12,739 (HK$100,000) for home contents. Enrolment is processed in-app using pre-filled details.\nCustomers who enrol by 31 October 2026 are eligible for supermarket vouchers worth up to $25.48 (HK$200), with additional rewards available for existing Mox Insure policyholders.\n($1.00 = HK$7.85)\n ",
